Text":"۞وَلَقَدۡ فَتَنَّا قَبۡلَهُمۡ قَوۡمَ فِرۡعَوۡنَ وَجَآءَهُمۡ رَسُولٞ كَرِيمٌ","TajweedText":"۞ وَلَقَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed> فَتَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا قَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>لَهُمْ قَوْمَ فِرْعَوْنَ وَج<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءَهُمْ رَسُو<tajweed class=ikhafa>لٌ ك</tajweed>َر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مٌ <span class=end>١٧</span>","End":"١٧","PageNumber":496,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":431,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":18,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَنۡ أَدُّوٓاْ إِلَيَّ عِبَادَ ٱللَّهِۖ إِنِّي لَكُمۡ رَسُولٌ أَمِينٞ","TajweedText":"أَنْ أَدّ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> إِلَىَّ عِبَادَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ‌ۖ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>ِى لَكُمْ رَسُولٌ أَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نٌ <span class=end>١٨</span>","End":"١٨","PageNumber":496,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":431,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false}]}